# Java Expert

## Description

This is a repository for the "Java Expert" course.

## How to run

To run the tests, you must have installed JUnit 4.

Then, you must run the following command:

```
mvn test
```

## How to generate the PDF

To generate the PDF, you must have installed the following libraries:

- [LaTeX](https://www.latex-project.org/)
- [JabRef](https://www.jabref.org/)
- [Pandoc](https://pandoc.org/)
- [PDFTeX](https://www.tug.org/applications/pdftex/)

Then, you must run the following command:

```
make
```

